---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CountUp from '../../components/CountUp.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": "Sephra USA Amazon Case Study, Golden Quarter Growth",
      "description": "How Visible Ads scaled Sephra USA's Amazon Ads account, doubling Q4 order volume year-on-year while ROAS rose and TACOS fell.",
      "datePublished": "2026-08-27",
      "dateModified": "2026-08-27",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Visible Ads",
        "url": "https://visible-ads.com"
      },
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Visible Ads",
        "url": "https://visible-ads.com"
      },
      "mainEntityOfPage": {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "https://visible-ads.com/case-studies/sephra-usa-amazon"
      },
      "about": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Sephra USA"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://visible-ads.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Case Studies", "item": "https://visible-ads.com/case-studies" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Sephra USA", "item": "https://visible-ads.com/case-studies/sephra-usa-amazon" }
      ]
    }
  ]
};

const table = [
  { label: 'Units ordered', y24: '3,732', y25: '8,050', change: '+116%' },
  { label: 'Orders', y24: '2,887', y25: '6,243', change: '+116%' },
  { label: 'Ad sales', y24: '$115.8K', y25: '$273.5K', change: '+136%' },
  { label: 'Total Amazon sales', y24: '$232.9K', y25: '$499.5K', change: '+114%' },
  { label: 'Ad spend', y24: '$15.0K', y25: '$27.8K', change: '+85%' },
  { label: 'ROAS', y24: '7.72x', y25: '9.84x', change: '+2.12x' },
  { label: 'ACOS', y24: '12.9%', y25: '10.2%', change: '2.8 pts better' },
  { label: 'TACOS', y24: '6.4%', y25: '5.6%', change: '0.9 pts better' },
];
---

<Layout title="Sephra USA Amazon Case Study, Golden Quarter Growth | Visible Ads" description="How Visible Ads scaled Sephra USA's Amazon Ads account, doubling Q4 order volume year-on-year while ROAS rose and TACOS fell." schema={schema}>

  <section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden" data-animate>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-navy-light"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-pattern opacity-10"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="text-sm text-slate-light mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <a href="/case-studies" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Case Studies</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span class="text-white">Sephra USA</span>
      </nav>
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-electric/20 text-electric-light text-sm font-medium rounded-full mb-6">Food &amp; Beverage Equipment</span>
      <img src="/images/clients/sephra.webp" alt="Sephra logo" class="h-10 mb-6 object-contain object-left brightness-0 invert" loading="lazy" />
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-heading font-extrabold text-white leading-tight mb-6">Sephra USA's Amazon Order Volume Doubled in a Single Golden Quarter</h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-light max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">Sephra USA's Q4 2025 Amazon Ads results against Q4 2024: units ordered up 116%, ad sales up 136%, and ROAS climbing from 7.72x to 9.84x while ACOS and TACOS both fell.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <CountUp value="116" suffix="%" label="Unit Growth YoY" />
        <CountUp value="9.84" suffix="x" label="Q4 2025 ROAS" />
        <CountUp prefix="$" value="273.5" suffix="K" label="Q4 Ad Sales" />
        <CountUp value="12.3" suffix="x" label="Marginal ROAS on New Spend" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white py-8">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <img src="/images/case-studies/sephra-usa-amazon-lifetime-performance.png" alt="Sephra USA Amazon Ads lifetime performance dashboard, showing ROAS, total cost, purchases and sales from 2020 to 2026 with Q4 2024 and Q4 2025 highlighted" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-gray-200" loading="lazy" />
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 text-center mt-3">Sephra USA's lifetime Amazon Ads performance to date. Sales velocity peaks into both Christmases. ROAS climbed further through the second half of 2025 and reached a lifetime high of 13x in April 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-sky-tint" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-electric/10 text-electric text-sm font-semibold rounded-full mb-4">The Challenge</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-8">A Seasonal Business Needs a Golden Quarter That Delivers</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Sephra USA sells chocolate fountains, chocolate melts and dessert equipment on Amazon US. Demand in this category concentrates hard into Q4. Most of the year's advertising decisions exist to prepare for eight or nine weeks of peak demand around Thanksgiving and Christmas.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Scaling into that window carries real risk. Push budget too early and cost per acquisition climbs before demand arrives. Push too late and competitors capture the shoppers already searching. Sephra USA needed an account run tightly enough to scale hard exactly when demand peaked. It needed to pull back just as fast once demand passed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-electric/10 text-electric text-sm font-semibold rounded-full mb-4">The Results</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Q4 2025 Against Q4 2024</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 max-w-2xl">Every headline metric moved in the right direction at once. Volume doubled. Efficiency improved. The extra spend earned a stronger return than the base it was built on.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-4xl overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b-2 border-navy">
              <th class="text-left py-3 px-4 font-heading font-bold text-navy">Metric</th>
              <th class="text-right py-3 px-4 font-heading font-bold text-navy">Q4 2024</th>
              <th class="text-right py-3 px-4 font-heading font-bold text-navy">Q4 2025</th>
              <th class="text-right py-3 px-4 font-heading font-bold text-electric">Change</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {table.map((row) => (
              <tr class="border-b border-gray-200">
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-700">{row.label}</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-700">{row.y24}</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-700 font-semibold">{row.y25}</td>
                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-electric font-semibold">{row.change}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 max-w-4xl mt-4">Basis: ad sales, spend and ROAS as published in Visible Ads' monthly reports. Total sales, units and orders from Amazon Seller Central ordered product sales.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-sky-tint" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-electric/10 text-electric text-sm font-semibold rounded-full mb-4">What Drove It</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Scale Fast, Cut Fast, Never on Autopilot</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-electric/10 text-electric rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold mb-4">1</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-3">Budget Rode the Winners</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Budgets rose into November and December on campaigns already returning 10x or better. Spend pulled back sharply in January. Every move followed demand rather than a fixed monthly plan.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-electric/10 text-electric rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold mb-4">2</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-3">Bids Moved Every Month</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Every campaign was reviewed monthly against its return. Bids rose where a keyword earned it and fell where it did not. Spend stayed concentrated on what was actually converting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-electric/10 text-electric rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold mb-4">3</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-3">The Core Line Carried Peak</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Chocolate stayed the strongest line throughout: $39K of ad sales in October rising to $53.3K in December. 509 fountains sold via ads across the quarter. The prior year's total was 411.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="glass-card p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-electric/10 text-electric text-sm font-semibold rounded-full mb-6">How This Account Is Run</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Numbers This Volatile Need Checking More Than Once a Month</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Q4 results like these come from an account watched daily. Bids are reviewed every Monday against the previous week's ACOS. Stock is checked every day against Buy Box status. The account itself is checked every morning for spend spikes and disapproved ads. Sephra USA gets a Wednesday reporting email, a live hourly dashboard and a monthly report with video walkthrough. It is the same operating standard we run on every account we manage.</p>
        <a href="/amazon#approach" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-electric font-medium mt-6">See our full Amazon Ads process <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-sky-tint" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Services Used</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="/amazon" class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-white rounded-full text-sm font-semibold text-electric hover:bg-electric hover:text-white transition-colors border border-electric/20">Amazon Ads</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-navy text-center mb-10">Related Case Studies</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <a href="/case-studies/sephra" class="group bg-sky-tint rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-electric uppercase tracking-wide">Food &amp; Beverage</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-navy mt-2 mb-2 group-hover:text-electric transition-colors">Sephra Europe</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">£2.31M in ad-driven revenue and 1,149% ROAS.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/case-studies/cfw" class="group bg-sky-tint rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-electric uppercase tracking-wide">Food &amp; Beverage</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-navy mt-2 mb-2 group-hover:text-electric transition-colors">CFW</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">£6M return from £500K Google Ads spend: 12x ROAS.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/case-studies/iwholesales" class="group bg-sky-tint rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-electric uppercase tracking-wide">eCommerce</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-navy mt-2 mb-2 group-hover:text-electric transition-colors">iWholesales</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">450% sales growth in a competitive niche market.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-navy" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-6">Ready for a Golden Quarter Like This?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-light mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Get a free, no-obligation audit of your Amazon Ads account. We'll show you exactly where the opportunities are before your next peak season.</p>
      <a href="/free-ads-audit" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-cta text-white font-semibold px-10 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-electric transition-colors text-lg">Get Your Free Amazon Audit</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
